X: 1
T: Dull Sir John
P: Figure Dance for eight
%R: jig
B: "The Compleat Country Dancing-Master" printed by John Walsh, London ca. 1740
S: 6: CCDM1 http://imslp.org/wiki/The_Compleat_Country_Dancing-Master_(Various) V.1 p.139 #183 (277)
Z: 2013 John Chambers <jc:trillian.mit.edu>
N: Walsh omits the diagram for this dance, which is in square formation.
M: 6/4
L: 1/4
K: Gdor
